cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Spatial proteomics pipeline (BDSC-TDS)"
abstract: >
  A Snakemake workflow for multiplexed spatial proteomics images (CODEX / PhenoCycler,
  COMET / Lunaphore, Xenium protein): image preparation, background subtraction, cell
  segmentation (Mesmer, Cellpose, VirTues), per-cell quantification, alignment to 10x Xenium,
  cell type annotation (TACIT) and per-cell foundation model embeddings (VirTues, KRONOS2).
